<title>NETHERLANDS: Heidemij 1996 net dips.</title>
<headline>Heidemij 1996 net dips.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-03-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Yr to Dec 31, 1996</p>
<p>(in millions of guilders unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>    Net per shr (guilders)	     1.40 vs   1.45</p>
<p>    Net profit			    26.1  vs  27.0</p>
<p>    Turnover			    1089.2  vs 900.4</p>
<p>    Dividend (guilders)		  0.55 vs   0.53</p>
<p>    Operating profit		    48.4  vs  42.1</p>
<p>    Interest charges		     4.3  vs   2.6</p>
<p>    Tax				     14.2  vs  11.3</p>
<p>    Extraordinary charges		2.0  vs  NIL</p>
<p>NOTE - Engineering consultancy Heidemij NV previously said it expected 1996 net profit to remain steady. -- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
</text>
